{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Oh that|strong=\"H3045\"you|strong=\"H6440\"would|strong=\"H6862\"tear the|strong=\"H6440\"heavens,  \nthat|strong=\"H3045\"you|strong=\"H6440\"would|strong=\"H6862\"come|strong=\"H3045\"down|strong=\"H6440\",  \nthat|strong=\"H3045\"the|strong=\"H6440\"mountains might quake|strong=\"H7264\"at|strong=\"H6440\"your|strong=\"H6440\"presence|strong=\"H6440\"—   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"as|strong=\"H6213\"when|strong=\"H6213\"fire kindles the|strong=\"H6440\"brushwood,  \nand|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"fire causes the|strong=\"H6440\"water to|strong=\"H3381\"boil.  \nMake|strong=\"H6213\"your|strong=\"H6440\"name known|strong=\"H3808\"to|strong=\"H3381\"your|strong=\"H6440\"adversaries,  \nthat|strong=\"H2022\"the|strong=\"H6440\"nations|strong=\"H6440\"may|strong=\"H6213\"tremble at|strong=\"H6213\"your|strong=\"H6440\"presence|strong=\"H6440\"!   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"When|strong=\"H7200\"you|strong=\"H6213\"did|strong=\"H6213\"awesome things|strong=\"H3808\"which|strong=\"H5869\"we|strong=\"H3068\"didn’t look|strong=\"H7200\"for|strong=\"H6213\",  \nyou|strong=\"H6213\"came down, and|strong=\"H5869\"the|strong=\"H8085\"mountains quaked at|strong=\"H6213\"your|strong=\"H7200\"presence|strong=\"H5869\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"For|strong=\"H6213\"from|strong=\"H2398\"of|strong=\"H1870\"old|strong=\"H5769\"men|strong=\"H6213\"have not|strong=\"H6213\"heard,  \nnor perceived by|strong=\"H1870\"the|strong=\"H6213\"ear,  \nnor has|strong=\"H6213\"the|strong=\"H6213\"eye seen a|strong=\"H3068\"God besides you|strong=\"H6213\",  \nwho|strong=\"H6213\"works|strong=\"H6213\"for|strong=\"H6213\"him|strong=\"H6213\"who|strong=\"H6213\"waits for|strong=\"H6213\"him|strong=\"H6213\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"You|strong=\"H3605\"meet him|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"rejoices and|strong=\"H6666\"does righteousness|strong=\"H6666\",  \nthose|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"remember you|strong=\"H3605\"in|strong=\"H1961\"your|strong=\"H3605\"ways.  \nBehold, you|strong=\"H3605\"were|strong=\"H1961\"angry, and|strong=\"H6666\"we|strong=\"H3068\"sinned.  \nWe|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H1961\"been|strong=\"H1961\"in|strong=\"H1961\"sin|strong=\"H5771\"for|strong=\"H3605\"a|strong=\"H3068\"long|strong=\"H3605\"time|strong=\"H1961\".  \nShall|strong=\"H7307\"we|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H1961\"saved?   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"we|strong=\"H3068\"have|strong=\"H3027\"all|strong=\"H4480\"become|strong=\"H7121\"like|strong=\"H6440\"one|strong=\"H4480\"who|strong=\"H3588\"is|strong=\"H8034\"unclean,  \nand|strong=\"H3027\"all|strong=\"H4480\"our|strong=\"H4480\"righteousness is|strong=\"H8034\"like|strong=\"H6440\"a|strong=\"H3068\"polluted garment.  \nWe|strong=\"H3588\"all|strong=\"H4480\"fade like|strong=\"H6440\"a|strong=\"H3068\"leaf;  \nand|strong=\"H3027\"our|strong=\"H4480\"iniquities|strong=\"H5771\", like|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"wind, take|strong=\"H2388\"us|strong=\"H6440\"away|strong=\"H4127\".   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"There|strong=\"H3605\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no|strong=\"H3605\"one|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"calls on|strong=\"H3027\"your|strong=\"H3068\"name,  \nwho|strong=\"H3605\"stirs himself|strong=\"H3027\"up|strong=\"H3605\"to|strong=\"H3068\"take|strong=\"H3027\"hold of|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H3605\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3027\"you|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H3068\"hidden your|strong=\"H3068\"face from|strong=\"H3027\"us|strong=\"H3027\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"have|strong=\"H3068\"consumed us|strong=\"H3027\"by|strong=\"H3027\"means|strong=\"H3027\"of|strong=\"H3068\"our|strong=\"H3068\"iniquities.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"But|strong=\"H5971\"now|strong=\"H4994\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\", you|strong=\"H3605\"are|strong=\"H5971\"our|strong=\"H3068\"Father.  \nWe|strong=\"H5704\"are|strong=\"H5971\"the|strong=\"H3605\"clay and|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H3605\"our|strong=\"H3068\"potter.  \nWe|strong=\"H5704\"all|strong=\"H3605\"are|strong=\"H5971\"the|strong=\"H3605\"work of|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"hand.   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"Don’t be|strong=\"H1961\"furious, LORD|strong=\"H3068\".  \nDon’t remember iniquity forever.  \nLook and|strong=\"H3389\"see, we|strong=\"H3068\"beg you|strong=\"H6726\",  \nwe|strong=\"H3068\"are|strong=\"H5892\"all your|strong=\"H1961\"people.   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"Your|strong=\"H3605\"holy|strong=\"H6944\"cities have|strong=\"H1961\"become|strong=\"H1961\"a|strong=\"H3068\"wilderness.  \nZion has|strong=\"H1961\"become|strong=\"H1961\"a|strong=\"H3068\"wilderness,  \nJerusalem a|strong=\"H3068\"desolation|strong=\"H2723\".   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"Our|strong=\"H3068\"holy and|strong=\"H3068\"our|strong=\"H3068\"beautiful house where|strong=\"H5921\"our|strong=\"H3068\"fathers praised you|strong=\"H5921\"is|strong=\"H3068\"burned with|strong=\"H3068\"fire.  \nAll|strong=\"H5704\"our|strong=\"H3068\"pleasant places are|strong=\"H3068\"laid waste.   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"Will you hold yourself back for these things, LORD|strong=\"H3068\"?  \nWill you keep silent and punish us very severely?   \n"}]}
